{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_13\">Problem 13</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 13\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cows give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> cans of milk in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8ab0ec5027c055e1b34dc345b1d8532b611bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> days, how many days will it take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/943833d247c8f1999dcda4665585ff4b6ecd4fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> cows to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b7a1e24a2c30f83eef0b443b7a511d5e2455b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> cans of milk?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfccee0314b739e7c2dd3a8bb631d17b6e875138.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{x(x+2)(x+5)}{(x+1)(x+3)}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\frac{x(x+1)(x+5)}{(x+2)(x+3)}\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(C) }\\frac{(x+1)(x+3)(x+5)}{x(x+2)}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\frac{(x+1)(x+3)}{x(x+2)(x+5)}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E) }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"400\" height=\"105\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, the problem states:\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0d4bc3de861548f83e010344ce6f6b989bfd6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" /> cans <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3645d60a237ffa6a155d4836574717662d2b08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\qquad x+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" /> days </center>\n<p>Multiply the current number of cows by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d49457d4bb29fd9b70805751292d379afa76d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+3}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> to get the number of cows you want, and divide the number of days by the same amount because an increase in cows will cause a decrease in time.\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/3/9c366e9ab71f922d72e2ab9d6b4d3629a0f14784.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\cdot \\frac{x+3}{x} \\qquad x+1 \\qquad (x+2) \\cdot \\frac{x}{x+3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"290\" height=\"39\" /></center>\n<p>Finally, multiply the current amount of cans by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d3239403a31e39151da7bb75701a4ecb07dfd0e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+5}{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"44\" height=\"39\" /> to get the number of cans you want, and multiply the number of days by the same amount because an increase in cans will cause an increase in time.\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef725c510f973163125cc859941363ad2fbed8af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\cdot \\frac{x+3}{x} \\qquad (x+1) \\cdot \\frac{x+5}{x+1} \\qquad (x+2) \\cdot \\frac{x}{x+3} \\cdot \\frac{x+5}{x+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"422\" height=\"39\" /> </center>\n<p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/8/628fc725488e14bb0011b7c1a922ac60e8f53a91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{x(x+2)(x+5)}{(x+1)(x+3)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"173\" height=\"54\" /> ~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">